AQ: 30 Questions Players Ask Most, Answered (2026)</h1><p class="mt-2 text-[12px] text-muted"><time dateTime="2026-09-07T13:00:00+00:00">7 September 2026</time></p><img src="/media/screenshots/1v1-lol-match.webp" alt="" width="1200" height="675" class="mt-5 w-full rounded-card"/><article class="prose-1v1 mt-6"><p>This page collects the questions people ask about 1v1.LOL most often, from "is it shut down?" to "what key is the wall on?", with short, direct answers. Every fact here matches what the game does today, on the community-run 1v1.LOL Reloaded build that <a href="/">this site</a> embeds, not the 2020 version most older guides describe. Jump to a section:</p>
